---

## 1. Purpose

NetworkTools is developed as a **student scientific research project** at the Posts and Telecommunications Institute of Technology — Ho Chi Minh City campus (PTIT HCM).

The source code is publicly available for the purposes of:

- learning and education;
- technical reference;
- source-code review;
- research transparency;
- software evaluation;
- individual experimentation;
- verification and reproduction of technical results.

Making the source code publicly accessible does **not** mean that the project is released as unrestricted open-source software.

---

## 2. Permitted Use

You may:

- view and read the source code;
- clone or download the repository for personal study;
- run the software for learning, testing, or evaluation;
- modify the software privately for experimentation or educational purposes;
- study the architecture, algorithms, database design, network automation mechanisms, user interface, and implementation techniques;
- reference ideas or techniques from the project in accordance with normal academic citation practices;
- cite NetworkTools as prior work or as a technical reference.

These permissions are granted only when the use complies with all restrictions in this License.

